---
---
<section class="py-16 bg-[#fffcf0]">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-4xl">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-8 mb-16">
      <div class="flex-1 hidden md:block">
        <div class="H_border"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="px-8">
        <h1 class="H_shape text-center whitespace-nowrap">
          問答 Q&A
        </h1>
      </div>
      <div class="flex-1 hidden md:block">
        <div class="H_border"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center mb-12 text-gray-600">
        <p class="text-lg">在這裡您可以找到許多問題和解答；如果仍有任何問題，能與澄星人聯繫</p>
        <p class="italic text-sm">This is where you will find most answers. If there should still be any questions left, don’t hesitate to contact us.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- FAQ Categories -->
    <div class="space-y-12">
      <!-- General QA -->
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-[40px] shadow-sm border border-[#fff4cb]">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#ff9600] mb-6 border-l-4 border-[#ffc04c] pl-4 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span>通常QA (General QA)</span>
        </h2>
        
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <details class="group border-b border-[#fff4cb] pb-4">
            <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-bold text-[#2D2E33] cursor-pointer list-none hover:text-[#ff9600] transition-colors">
              <span>關於這提供哪些魔法服務呢?</span>
              <span class="text-[#ffc04c] transition-transform group-open:rotate-180">▼</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="mt-4 text-gray-600 pl-4 py-2 border-l-2 border-[#fffcf0]">
              平面、名片、布條、DM以及網站視覺相關畫妝術設計，主項目主打網站視覺趨勢方向。
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="group border-b border-[#fff4cb] pb-4">
            <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-bold text-[#2D2E33] cursor-pointer list-none hover:text-[#ff9600] transition-colors">
              <span>這邊魔法服務有哪些特色?</span>
              <span class="text-[#ffc04c] transition-transform group-open:rotate-180">▼</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="mt-4 text-gray-600 pl-4 py-2 border-l-2 border-[#fffcf0]">
              透過人與人交流的調和，配合3大獨特魔法術(畫作化妝術、編排吸引力法、調配色劑劑法)，用真摯與愛去設計傳遞給他人的視覺體驗。
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="group">
            <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-bold text-[#2D2E33] cursor-pointer list-none hover:text-[#ff9600] transition-colors">
              <span>若需要魔法服務怎麼聯繫呢?</span>
              <span class="text-[#ffc04c] transition-transform group-open:rotate-180">▼</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="mt-4 text-gray-600 pl-4 py-2 border-l-2 border-[#fffcf0] space-y-4">
              <p>1. 可以到選單中→<strong><a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}contact`} class="text-[#ff9600] hover:underline">“Contact發訊”</a></strong>頁面，填寫留言訊息發送。</p>
              <p>2. 可以到<strong>澄視維度設計<a href="https://www.instagram.com/jcvision_design/" target="_blank" class="text-[#ff9600] hover:underline">IG</a></strong>或<a href="https://www.facebook.com/c.design.vision" target="_blank" class="text-[#ff9600] hover:underline"><strong>FB</strong></a>，留言或發送訊息。</p>
              <p>3. 或直接用 <strong>E-MAIL 到 <span class="text-[#ff9600]">jcvision.design@gmail.com</span></strong> 詢問相關魔法服務唷。</p>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Service QA -->
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-[40px] shadow-sm border border-[#fff4cb]">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#ff9600] mb-6 border-l-4 border-[#ffc04c] pl-4 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span>服務QA (Service QA)</span>
        </h2>
        
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <details class="group border-b border-[#fff4cb] pb-4">
            <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-bold text-[#2D2E33] cursor-pointer list-none hover:text-[#ff9600] transition-colors">
              <span>請問服務預算如何預估?</span>
              <span class="text-[#ffc04c] transition-transform group-open:rotate-180">▼</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="mt-4 text-gray-600 pl-4 py-2 border-l-2 border-[#fffcf0]">
              看服務內容項目、分成平面、名片、布條、DM 或網站設計量、程度和設計時間有區別，通常依市場價格為基準在與客戶進行微調。
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="group">
            <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-bold text-[#2D2E33] cursor-pointer list-none hover:text-[#ff9600] transition-colors">
              <span>如果有魔法服務要修改怎麼算?</span>
              <span class="text-[#ffc04c] transition-transform group-open:rotate-180">▼</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="mt-4 text-gray-600 pl-4 py-2 border-l-2 border-[#fffcf0]">
              如果要調整設計，設計完成提供前3次免費修改，超出3次，要依修改的程度另外算，但是會盡可能在設計製作時讓彼此達到契合。
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Payment QA -->
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-[40px] shadow-sm border border-[#fff4cb]">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#ff9600] mb-6 border-l-4 border-[#ffc04c] pl-4 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span>付款/退款相關QA (Payment/Refund QA)</span>
        </h2>
        
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <details class="group border-b border-[#fff4cb] pb-4">
            <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-bold text-[#2D2E33] cursor-pointer list-none hover:text-[#ff9600] transition-colors">
              <span>想進行魔法服務如何付款?</span>
              <span class="text-[#ffc04c] transition-transform group-open:rotate-180">▼</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="mt-4 text-gray-600 pl-4 py-2 border-l-2 border-[#fffcf0]">
              可以先與站長澄星人聯繫，看希望進行什麼類別的魔法服務，然後提供給您匯款帳戶進行付款。
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="group">
            <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-bold text-[#2D2E33] cursor-pointer list-none hover:text-[#ff9600] transition-colors">
              <span>在進行魔法服務但之後想退款?</span>
              <span class="text-[#ffc04c] transition-transform group-open:rotate-180">▼</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="mt-4 text-gray-600 pl-4 py-2 border-l-2 border-[#fffcf0]">
              魔法服務會先收預收訂金，如果中途設計不符合需求需要解約或放棄設計，訂金部分可能無法退還，但其餘若以支付款項可以將款項退回。
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
    /* Prevent default summary arrow */
    summary::-webkit-details-marker {
        display: none;
    }
</style>
